Maya the Bee Movie is a family, animation film directed by Alexs Stadermann.

3
00:15:31,764 --> 00:15:37,764
A bubbly little bumblebee rebels against the rules of the hive to make all kinds of
friends—from violin-playing grasshoppers to a hornet named Sting.

4
00:20:42,352 --> 00:20:48,352
Maya (voice), played by Coco Jack Gillies.

5
